  "scope": "The real mncs.test.digest source was compiled into one multi-callable application-build/5 artifact. An imported comment edit reran the full frontend and reused the selected verified VM closure while rebinding all three current callable interfaces. A semantics-preserving edit to reachable mncs.test.suite::empty invalidated the closure and regenerated the artifact. Three Stage-0-backed build_digest inputs and both schema callables then ran in one bounded canonical VM batch and one retained VM session; the retained session recovered from a low-fuel interruption and rejected typed input before completing the same oracle-backed callable set in that process. This does not reuse Language verified facts and does not establish Forge/Environment/Store execution or full mncs-test conversion."
